post-it: CD-tray keeps on opening and closing
symptoms:
	CD tray opens by itself
		shows: while Windows runs, the CD tray opens and closes every few seconds
checks:
	CD tray stays shut
		shows: while Windows runs, the tray opens and closes every few seconds
	StartUp holds only known programs
		shows: a shortcut to BIZOPP.EXE, which is in C:\WINDOWS
software steps:
	Get the CompuFun AntiVirus floppy from storage
	Put it in drive A: and run SETUP.EXE
	Run CompuFun AntiVirus, scan, and Clean what it finds
notes:
	Broken part: OS
